  "details": "Your Supporter Morrigan said i should post my problem as bug report so yeah here you go\n\nClean Reinstallation\n\nUninstalled VRChat via Steam\n\nManually removed all remaining folders:\n\n%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\n\n%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\VRChat\n\nPerformed a completely fresh reinstall via Steam\n\nResult: Issue persists\n\n2. Cache and Shader Cache Cleanup\n\nManually cleared VRChat cache:\n\n%USERPROFILE%\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\n\nCleared NVIDIA shader caches:\n\n%LOCALAPPDATA%\\NVIDIA\\DXCache\n\n%LOCALAPPDATA%\\NVIDIA\\GLCache\n\nResult: No improvement\n\n3. GPU Driver Clean Reinstallation (DDU)\n\nUsed Display Driver Uninstaller (DDU) in Safe Mode\n\nCompletely removed all NVIDIA driver remnants\n\nInstalled a fresh GPU driver version\n\nResult: Issue still reproducible\n\n4. Avatar / Content Isolation Test\n\nSwitched to VRChat fallback avatars\n\nPurpose: rule out avatar shader or asset corruption\n\nResult: Freeze still occurs before avatar/world load\n\n5. Launch Parameter Testing\n\nTested multiple Steam launch options:\n\n--no-vr\n\n--safe-mode\n\n--disable-hw-video-decoding\n\n-force-d3d11\n\n-screen-fullscreen 0\n\nResult: No change in behavior\n\n6. Easy Anti-Cheat (EAC) Tests\n\nRan EasyAntiCheat_EOS_Setup.exe → Repair Service\n\nAlso tested launch with:\n\n--disable-eac\n\nResult: Freeze still occurs\n\n7. Overlay / Hook Software Disabled\n\nDisabled all overlays:\n\nDiscord Overlay\n\nNVIDIA GeForce Experience Overlay\n\nSteam Overlay\n\nResult: No effect\n\n8. VRChat Registry Reset\n\nDeleted:\n\nHKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\VRChat\n\nPurpose: remove persistent corrupted configuration\n\nResult: Issue persists\n\n9. Hardware-Accelerated GPU Scheduling (HAGS)\n\nDisabled via:\n\nWindows Settings → Display → Graphics → Default Graphics Settings\n\nSystem rebooted\n\nResult: No improvement\n\n10. Multiplane Overlay (MPO) Disabled\n\nAdded registry value:\n\nHKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Dwm\n\nOverlayTestMode = 5 (DWORD 32-bit)\n\nSystem restarted\n\nResult: Freeze still occurs\n\n11. Network Region / Server Configuration\n\nDefault region: US_West\n\nAttempted to change region to Europe\n\nLimitation: unable to access in-game settings due to freeze occurring before UI load\n\n12. Additional Network Behavior Observation\n\nFreeze occurs before full login completion\n\nPossible involvement of:\n\nAuthentication handshake\n\nAPI initialization\n\nPhoton / relay connection process\n\nCurrent Status\n\nIssue is fully reproducible at the login screen\n\nNo access to in-game menus\n\nNo change after:\n\nClean reinstall\n\nCache and shader cleanup\n\nGPU driver reset (DDU)\n\nEAC repair / disable attempts\n\nHAGS / MPO registry tweaks\n\nLaunch parameter variations",
